<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3810/15  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7436/43  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9625/30  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4610/20  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.97/01   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8760/80  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1697.2/7.5 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     114.82/87  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.7394/69  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.3153/27  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.6389/09  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6543/50</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$333.80/30</p>
</text>
